# SensorHub application options

config SENSORHUB_MQTT
	bool "MQTT telemetry bridge (stub)"
	help
	  Forward every sample the logger thread receives to the MQTT bridge in
	  subsys/mqtt_bridge/. The bridge is a stub: it does not connect to a
	  broker yet, it logs a once-per-second summary of the JSON payloads it
	  would publish to sensorhub/telemetry.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
